                     </content>
                     <content styleCode="bold">
                        <br/> Tips for Managing Heartburn</content>
                  </paragraph>
                  <list listType="unordered" styleCode="disc">
                     <item>Do not lie flat or bend over after eating</item>
                     <item>Do not wear tight-fitting clothing around the stomach</item>
                     <item>Do not eat before bedtime</item>
                     <item>Raise the head of your bed</item>
                     <item>Avoid heartburn-causing foods such as rich, spicy, fatty or fried foods, chocolate, caffeine, alcohol, and certain fruits and vegetables</item>
                     <item>Eat slowly and avoid big meals</item>
                     <item>If overweight, lose weight</item>
                     <item>Quit smoking</item>
                  </list>
